<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said Monday it had cut its rating on the shares of Seagate Technology Inc to maintain from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Mark Jordan also said he reduced his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $3.50 per share from $4.00.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our basic belief is that on a valuation basis, given the somewhat softer near-term outlook, we would like to see how the current quarter comes in before we commit more money,&quot; Jordan said.</p>
<p>-- said he remains &quot;constructive&quot; on the technology sector.</p>
<p>-- Seagate shares were off 1-15/16 to 40-15/16.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
